      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved BOQ and project cost estimate (W5275)
Frequency: Per insurance claim cycle
Volume: ~3-5 insurance audit events annually
Owner: Insurance Administrator
Participants: Loss Adjuster, Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate, Chief Accountant (VS-17.1)
Source: workflow W5276 — Insurance Loss Adjuster Audit Coordination and Proof of Loss Submission</bpmn:documentation>
