        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Coordinate site visit and inspection with designated Loss Adjuster.
Responsible (R): Insurance Administrator
Accountable (A): Insurance Administrator
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5276_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5276_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
