Accountable (A): Store Manager / DC Supervisor
Duration: 2-3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5277_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5277_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
