      <bpmn:userTask id="W5278_Task7" name="Review insurance settlement offer; compare valuation against BOQ.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Review insurance settlement offer; compare valuation against BOQ.
Responsible (R): Insurance Administrator
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 2-3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5278_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5278_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5278_Task8" name="Negotiate settlement adjustments with underwriter if discrepancies exist.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Negotiate settlement adjustments with underwriter if discrepancies exist.
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 3-5 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5278_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5278_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5278_Task9" name="Accept final settlement offer and monitor fund transfer clearance.">
