Responsible (R): Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5278_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5278_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
