Accountable (A): Risk Management Specialist
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5280_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5280_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
